72 706 Td () Tj
72 692 Td (PURPOSE AND AUDIENCE) Tj
72 678 Td (This document explains what each major section of the application does, how it works at a) Tj
72 664 Td (high level, and why it exists. It is written for stakeholders, developers, and operators) Tj
72 650 Td (who need a clear map of the system’s features and flows.) Tj
72 636 Td () Tj
