72 594 Td (1. PROJECT OVERVIEW \(WHAT & WHY\)) Tj
72 580 Td (The project is a React-based inventory and point‑of‑sale \(POS\) system that supports sales,) Tj
72 566 Td (customer management, stock control, and business operations such as production tracking) Tj
72 552 Td (and expenses. It integrates role‑based access control and real‑time updates for) Tj
72 538 Td (operational accuracy.) Tj
72 524 Td () Tj
72 510 Td (Why this exists:) Tj
72 496 Td (• Small and growing businesses need to track stock, sales, customers, and production in) Tj
72 482 Td (one place.) Tj
72 468 Td (• Operators need a fast POS workflow with receipts and credit tracking.) Tj
72 454 Td (• Managers need analytics, reports, and operational oversight.) Tj
72 440 Td () Tj
72 426 Td (---) Tj
72 412 Td () Tj
72 398 Td (2. APPLICATION STRUCTURE \(HOW IT’S ORGANIZED\)) Tj
72 384 Td (The app is built with Create React App and uses React Router for page navigation. Feature) Tj
72 370 Td (code lives under `src/app`, with components in feature‑specific folders and data access) Tj
72 356 Td (through Redux Toolkit + RTK Query.) Tj
72 342 Td () Tj
72 328 Td (Key structural layers:) Tj
72 314 Td (• **Routing Layer**: Defines public vs. protected routes and role‑restricted features.) Tj
72 300 Td (• **State/Data Layer**: Redux Toolkit slices + RTK Query for fetch/update.) Tj
72 286 Td (• **UI Layer**: React components \(React‑Bootstrap, MUI, etc.\).) Tj
72 272 Td () Tj
72 258 Td (---) Tj
72 244 Td () Tj
72 230 Td (3. ROUTING AND ACCESS CONTROL \(WHAT IT DOES & WHY\)) Tj
72 216 Td (WHAT IT DOES) Tj
72 202 Td (Routes are split into:) Tj
72 188 Td (• **Public pages** \(login, password reset\).) Tj
72 174 Td (• **Protected pages** \(dashboard, POS, inventory, customers, reports, production, etc.\).) Tj
72 160 Td (• **Role‑restricted pages** \(admin‑only pages like documents and packages\).) Tj
72 146 Td () Tj
72 132 Td (HOW IT WORKS) Tj
72 118 Td (• `PersistLogin` restores session state on reload.) Tj
72 104 Td (• `RequireAuth` wraps routes and checks user roles.) Tj
72 90 Td () Tj
