72 636 Td (4. INVENTORY / STOCK MANAGEMENT \(WHAT, HOW, WHY\)) Tj
72 622 Td (WHAT IT DOES) Tj
72 608 Td (Inventory management lets staff create, edit, search, export, and delete stock items. It) Tj
72 594 Td (also calculates aggregate stock value and total quantities.) Tj
72 580 Td () Tj
72 566 Td (HOW IT WORKS) Tj
72 552 Td (• Data is fetched via RTK Query endpoints \(`getStock`, `addStock`, `updateStock`,) Tj
72 538 Td (`deleteStock`\).) Tj
72 524 Td (• UI lists stock items with filtering and sorting.) Tj
72 510 Td (• Exports to CSV/PDF are available for reporting and offline sharing.) Tj
72 496 Td () Tj
72 482 Td (WHY) Tj
72 468 Td (Accurate stock counts prevent overselling, reduce shrinkage, and help with procurement) Tj
72 454 Td (decisions.) Tj
72 440 Td () Tj
72 426 Td (---) Tj
72 412 Td () Tj
72 398 Td (5. POS \(POINT OF SALE\) FLOW \(WHAT, HOW, WHY\)) Tj
72 384 Td (WHAT IT DOES) Tj
72 370 Td (POS allows a cashier to search products, add them to a cart, apply discounts/tax, select) Tj
72 356 Td (payment method, record payment, and generate receipts. It also supports holding a sale for) Tj
72 342 Td (later completion.) Tj
72 328 Td () Tj
72 314 Td (HOW IT WORKS) Tj
72 300 Td (• Products are pulled from stock \(`selectStock` selector\).) Tj
72 286 Td (• Cart logic enforces quantity limits against stock.) Tj
72 272 Td (• Totals \(subtotal, discount, tax, total\) are computed in memory.) Tj
72 258 Td (• `makeSales` mutation persists the sale to the backend.) Tj
72 244 Td (• Receipt UI is shown after completion, with print/PDF download.) Tj
72 230 Td () Tj
72 216 Td (WHY) Tj
72 202 Td (POS is the revenue engine of the system. It needs speed, accuracy, and receipts for) Tj
72 188 Td (audit/compliance.) Tj
72 174 Td () Tj
72 160 Td (---) Tj
72 146 Td () Tj
72 132 Td (6. SALES & CUSTOMER TRACKING \(WHAT, HOW, WHY\)) Tj
72 118 Td (WHAT IT DOES) Tj
72 104 Td (Sales records capture customer purchases, payment details, and any dues. Customers can) Tj
72 90 Td (have multiple orders or credit balances.) Tj
